{"ref":"BDB, מְשִׁסָּה²","hw":"מְשִׁסָּה²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">מְשִׁסָּה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. booty, plunder</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.14\">2 K 21:14</a> +, so <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.24\">Is 42:24</a> Qr (<span dir=\"rtl\">מְשִׁסָּה</span> Gi, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשִׁיסָּה</span> Baer; Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">משוסה</span>, usually read <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשׁוּסָּה</span>, < read <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשׁוֹסֶה</span>, v. <a data-ref=\"BDB, שָׁסָה\" href=\"/BDB,_שָׁסָה\", dir=\"rtl\">שׁסה</a> <strong>Pōʿ.</strong>); pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְשִׁסּוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 2:7\" href=\"/Habakkuk.2.7\">Hb 2:7</a>;—<em>plunder, spoil, prey</em>, usually <span dir=\"rtl\">הָיָה לִמ׳</span> (and ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בַּז</span>) <a data-ref=\"II Kings 21:14\" href=\"/II_Kings.21.14\">2 K 21:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:16\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.16\">Je 30:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 2:7\" href=\"/Job.2.7\">Jb 2:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Zephaniah 1:13\" href=\"/Zephaniah.1.13\">Zp 1:13</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁמָמָה</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.22\">Is 42:22</a> (v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.24\">24</a> see above).","next":"BDB, שָׁסַע","prev":"BDB, שָׁסַס"}